BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:yAsS5WVZpvF4lzQPKgCT5
SUMMARY:The Princess Diaries
DTSTAMP:20260809T040754Z
DTSTART:20260816T191500Z
DESCRIPTION:Mia Thermopolis Mignonette Grimaldi\, Princess of Genovia\, had
	 a lot to learn about royal life&mdash\;luckily\, you already have the sty
	le down. Join us for a special Girls Gone Mild screening of this quintesse
	ntial classic. Want to level up your look? Add on our Charm Bracelet Packa
	ge to craft your own custom jewelry before the show. It's the perfect way 
	to channel your inner princess (no painful posture lessons required). Grab
	 your besties and get ready for a night of pure\, tiara-worthy nostalgia!\
	n\nhttps://rooftopcinemaclub.com/us/houston/uptown/screenings/the-princess
	-diaries-22894\n\nFrom Rooftop Cinema Club Houston
URL:https://rooftopcinemaclub.com/us/houston/uptown/screenings/the-princess
	-diaries-22894
GEO:29.7496;-95.4618
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:rooftop-cinema-club-houston
